{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Cannot close: AC3 is blocked by `superior-trifling-dunlin`, not by this ticket's own fix\n\nStatus of each criterion, honestly:\n\n- **AC1 — MET.** `review_plan` through the deployed server returns a real plan-review verdict\n  (populated `advisory`/`indeterminate` findings, deterministic floor P1-P11 run) instead of\n  `cannot resolve ref 'origin/main' to a commit in '.'`. Verified live.\n- **AC4 — MET.** The deployed container exposes a real git object DB at\n  `/var/gerrit/site/mcp-code`; `git -C ... rev-parse origin/main` resolves, and `REBAR_ROOT`\n  points at it.\n- **AC2 — NOT VERIFIED.** I have not called `verify_completion` through the deployed endpoint. Not\n  ticking it on the assumption that it behaves like `review_plan`.\n- **AC3 / DD1 / LIVE VALIDATION — BLOCKED, and not by this defect.** AC3 requires a PASS to\n  persist a signed attestation. The verdict is INDETERMINATE, but no longer for the reason this\n  ticket is about: the ref resolves fine and the LLM leg runs (`llm_ran: true`, 27 calls). It is\n  INDETERMINATE because the agentic VERIFY pass dies with\n  `step 'review@then/prerequisite_verify' failed: This event loop is already running` — the\n  separate P1 `superior-trifling-dunlin`, now linked `blocks`. An INDETERMINATE is never signed,\n  so no attestation can be earned through the MCP surface until that lands.\n\n**This ticket's own fix is done and proven.** Gerrit 2275 merged; the ref-resolution defect is\ngone from the deployed server. What remains is a different defect standing between here and a\nsigned attestation, which is why this stays open rather than being ticked through.\n\nSequence to close: land `superior-trifling-dunlin` (fix committed at `2fe9a3313c04`, unpushed) →\nredeploy → re-run `review_plan` → confirm a PASS signs, and separately exercise\n`verify_completion` for AC2."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787884237284557001,"uuid":"0495d5ee-f729-495f-bbd6-1a93f3318fbc"}